nt.com/NousR...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":16},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"hermescmd.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"noazresearch.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://hermes-agent.noazresearch.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Hermes Agent | Nous Research","snippet":"Open Source • MIT License  THE AGENT THAT GROWS WITH YOU  Install desktop app  /\\-_=+|< -/= ~:*-/  Install via terminal  [Button: Windows]  powershell -c \"iex (irm hermes-agent-nousresearch.com/app/i...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":17},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"noazresearch.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"nono.sh","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://nono.sh/docs/cli/clients/codex?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Codex - Nono Docs","snippet":"Agents & Clients  CODEX  Sandboxing OpenAI Codex CLI with nono  Codex is OpenAI’s CLI coding agent. It reads repositories, writes files, runs commands, and stores local session state. Running it unde...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":18},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"nono.sh"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"openai.ac.cn","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://developers.openai.ac.cn/codex/agent-approvals-security?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"代理审批与安全 – Codex | OpenAI 开发者 - OpenAI 教程","snippet":"AGENT 审批与安全  如何通过沙盒、审批及网络控制安全地运行 Codex  复制页面  Codex 有助于保护您的代码与数据，并降低滥用风险。  本页面介绍了如何安全地运行 Codex，包括沙盒、审批和网络访问控制。如果您正在寻找用于扫描已连接 GitHub 仓库的 Codex Security 产品，请参阅 Codex Security。  默认情况下，代理运行在关闭网络访问的状态下。在本...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":19},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"openai.ac.cn"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://developers.openai.ac.cn/codex/cli/reference?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"命令行选项 – Codex CLI | OpenAI 开发者 - OpenAI 教程","snippet":"命令行选项  Codex 终端客户端的选项和标志  复制页面  如何阅读本参考手册  本页面收录了所有已记录的 Codex CLI 命令和标志。使用交互式表格按键名或描述进行搜索。每个部分都指出了该选项是稳定版还是实验版，并指出了存在风险的组合。  CLI 大部分默认设置继承自 `~/.codex/config.toml`。你在命令行传递的任何 `-c key=value` 重写设置在本次调用中...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":30},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"openai.ac.cn"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://developers.openai.ac.cn/codex/cli/slash-commands?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Codex CLI 中的斜杠命令 | OpenAI 开发者 - OpenAI 教程","snippet":"CODEX CLI 中的斜杠命令  在交互式会话中控制 Codex  复制页面  斜杠命令让您能以键盘优先的方式快速控制 Codex。在编辑器中输入 `/` 即可打开斜杠弹出菜单，选择一个命令，Codex 就会执行诸如切换模型、调整权限或总结长对话等操作，而无需离开终端。  本指南将向您展示如何：  * 为任务找到合适的内置斜杠命令 * 使用 `/model`、`/fast`、`/persona...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":42},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"openai.ac.cn"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://developers.openai.ac.cn/codex/config-reference?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"配置参考 – Codex | OpenAI 开发者 - OpenAI 教程","snippet":"配置参考  Codex config.toml 和 requirements.toml 的完整参考  复制页面  将此页面作为 Codex 配置文件可搜索的参考资料。如需概念性指导和示例，请从配置基础和高级配置开始。  `CONFIG.TOML`  用户级配置位于 `~/.codex/config.toml`。你也可以在 `.codex/config.toml` 文件中添加项目级覆盖。Codex...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":44},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"openai.ac.cn"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"hermesagent101.dev","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://hermesagent101.dev/about?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"About | HermesAgent 101","snippet":"Hermes Agent 101  ABOUT HERMES AGENT  A practical overview of Hermes as a real autonomous runtime, not a vague AI product category.  Unofficial third-party site. HermesAgent 101 is an independent tuto...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":21},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"hermesagent101.dev"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://hermesagent101.dev/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"The Complete Guide to Hermes Agent | HermesAgent 101","snippet":"BEST TUTORIALS & GUIDES  HermesAgent 101 aims to be the best Hermes Agent resource hub.  Contributions welcome — add resources, improve content, share your