、WSL2に対応し、curlコマンド1つで前提条件なしにインストールできます。サーバーに住み、学んだことを記憶し、長く動かすほど能力が高まります。  オープンソース · MITライセンス · Nous Rese...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":28},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"hermes-agent.org"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://hermes-agent.org/about/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"About Hermes Agent — Open-Source AI Agent by Nous Research","snippet":"WHAT IS HERMES AGENT?  Hermes Agent is an open-source autonomous AI agent built by Nous Research and released in February 2026. It's not a coding copilot tethered to an IDE or a chatbot wrapper aroun...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":35},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"hermes-agent.org"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://hermes-agent.org/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Hermes Agent — Open-Source AI Agent with Persistent Memory","snippet":"HERMES AGENT  The AI agent that grows with you.  Install it on your server, give it your messaging accounts, and it becomes a persistent personal agent — learning your projects, building its own skil...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":36},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"hermes-agent.org"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://hermes-agent.org/zh-tw/about/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"About Hermes Agent — Open-Source AI Agent by Nous Research","snippet":"什麼是 HERMES AGENT？  Hermes Agent 是 Nous Research 開發的開源自主 AI 智能體，於 2026 年 2 月發布。支援 Linux、macOS 和 WSL2，一條 curl 命令即可安裝，無需任何前置依賴。運行越久能力越強。  開源 · MIT 授權 · Nous Research 出品。所有資料存儲在你的機器上，無遙測、無追蹤、無雲端鎖定。  與眾不同...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":37},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"hermes-agent.org"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"mifune.dev","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://oh.mifune.dev/docs/harnesses/codex?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Codex | Open Harness","snippet":"CODEX  Codex is OpenAI's CLI coding agent. It takes a natural-language task description and autonomously writes code, edits files, runs tests, and commits changes — with no interactive back-and-forth...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":33},"pub_date":1782604800.0,"attribution":"mifune.dev"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"openwebui.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://docs.openwebui.com/getting-started/quick-start/connect-an-agent/hermes-agent/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Hermes Agent / Open WebUI","snippet":"HERMES AGENT  Use Open WebUI as the chat frontend for Nous Research's autonomous AI agent.  Hermes Agent by Nous Research is an autonomous AI agent with built-in tools: terminal access, file operatio...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":34},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"openwebui.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"opensourcedrop.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.opensourcedrop.com/tools/NousResearch/hermes-agent?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"hermes-agent | The Open Source Drop","snippet":"HERMES-AGENT  The agent that grows with you  221.5k ★+3.6k/wk established PythonMIT License →trending  View on GitHub →Compare in AI Agent Frameworks →Homepage →  Replaces:OpenAI Assistants API  See...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":41},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"opensourcedrop.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"zenn.dev","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://zenn.dev/yorifuji/articles/8451e3474b7d4b?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"Codex CLI の基本","snippet":"`Agent (full access)` は所謂 `dangerous mode` です、こちらを使うとリスクと引き換えに煩わしさが減ります。  ALLOW/DENY 設定  `~/.codex/rules` に rule ファイルを追加することでコマンド単位で許可を制御可能です。  iframehttps://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/docs/ex...","ref_id":{"turn_index":1,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":43},"pub_date":1766188800.0,"attribution":"zenn.dev"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://zenn.dev/dokusy/articles/99af2fae0f1291?utm_source=chatgpt.com","title":"codexにcodexの徹底解説をしてもらった","snippet":"APPROVAL と SA